From: Project contributors <contributors@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] firewall4: probe IPv6 fullcone support before using it

defaults.fullcone6 emits the nft "fullcone" expression, which needs the
out-of-tree nft_fullcone kernel module.  Unlike defaults.fullcone it was
never probed, so enabling it without the module made the whole ruleset
fail to load.  Check it with nft_try_fullcone() and disable it with a
warning when the expression is unavailable.
---
--- a/root/usr/share/ucode/fw4.uc
+++ b/root/usr/share/ucode/fw4.uc
@@ -2235,6 +2235,12 @@ return {
 			warn("nft_try_masq_fullcone failed, disable fullcone globally\n");
 		}
 
+		/* IPv6 full cone needs the nft_fullcone kernel module */
+		if (defs.fullcone6 && !nft_try_fullcone()) {
+			delete defs.fullcone6;
+			warn("nft_try_fullcone failed, disable IPv6 fullcone globally\n");
+		}
+
 		this.state.defaults = defs;
 	},
 
